# wrangler reads this file for local vars and secrets, and `@cloudflare/vite-plugin`
# keeps that behaviour under `vite dev`. It is committed as an EXAMPLE only — copy it
# to `.dev.vars`, which is gitignored.
#
# Uncomment to reach the development container's Rails. The host is not a label:
# Rails dispatches on the Host header to `Core::Org::…`. Left unset, this Core fails
# closed — Rails-owned paths answer 503 and `/health` reports Rails as not configured,
# which is what `pnpm test:api`, Playwright and CI expect. See
# adr/018-core-rails-direct-internet.md.
# RAILS_ORIGIN=http://core.org.localhost:3000
